  "ideas": [
    {
      "id": "structured-cot-0",
      "text": "将多个塑料瓶垂直串联并填充土壤，固定在阳台栏杆上形成垂直菜园，因为塑料瓶耐水且轻便，可节省空间。",
      "taskId": "aut-bottle",
      "configId": "structured-cot",
      "generation": 1,
      "agent": "structured-cot",
      "source": "baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "structured-cot-1",
      "text": "把塑料瓶横向剖开，填充蜡和棉芯，制成简易蜡烛模具，因为塑料瓶易切割且蜡冷却后易脱模。",
      "taskId": "aut-bottle",
      "configId": "structured-cot",
      "generation": 1,
      "agent": "structured-cot",
      "source": "baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "structured-cot-2",
      "text": "将塑料瓶切成条状，编织成宠物玩具或垫子，因为塑料条柔韧且耐用，可替代传统编织材料。",
      "taskId": "aut-bottle",
      "configId": "structured-cot",
      "generation": 1,
      "agent": "structured-cot",
      "source": "baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "structured-cot-3",
      "text": "利用塑料瓶的透明性和浮力，制成浮标或小型浮台，用于钓鱼或水上活动，因为塑料瓶密封后浮力大且醒目。",
      "taskId": "aut-bottle",
      "configId": "structured-cot",
      "generation": 1,
      "agent": "structured-cot",
      "source": "baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "structured-cot-4",
      "text": "将塑料瓶底部切除，倒置插入土壤中作为深层灌溉器，因为瓶内水缓慢渗入土中，可保持土壤湿润。",
      "taskId": "aut-bottle",
      "configId": "structured-cot",
      "generation": 1,
      "agent": "structured-cot",
      "source": "baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "structured-cot-5",
      "text": "把塑料瓶剪成螺旋条，缠绕在金属杆上制成捕虫器或鸟刺，因为塑料条尖锐且耐候，可防止鸟类停留。",
      "taskId": "aut-bottle",
      "configId": "structured-cot",
      "generation": 1,
      "agent": "structured-cot",
      "source": "baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "structured-cot-6",
      "text": "将塑料瓶内部涂黑，装满水后放在阳光下作为太阳能热水器，因为黑色吸热且塑料瓶保温，可加热水。",
      "taskId": "aut-bottle",
      "configId": "structured-cot",
      "generation": 1,
      "agent": "structured-cot",
      "source": "baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "structured-cot-7",
      "text": "把塑料瓶切成环状，连接成链条用于固定或悬挂物品，因为塑料环强度高且可灵活连接。",
      "taskId": "aut-bottle",
      "configId": "structured-cot",
      "generation": 1,
      "agent": "structured-cot",
      "source": "baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "structured-cot-8",
      "text": "将塑料瓶压扁并热封边缘，制成防水袋或小包，因为塑料瓶材料防水且热封后密封。",
      "taskId": "aut-bottle",
      "configId": "structured-cot",
      "generation": 1,
      "agent": "structured-cot",
      "source": "baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "structured-cot-9",
      "text": "利用塑料瓶的圆柱形状，制成简易的鼓或打击乐器，因为敲击瓶身可发出不同音调。",
      "taskId": "aut-bottle",
      "configId": "structured-cot",
      "generation": 1,
      "agent": "structured-cot",
      "source": "baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "structured-cot-10",
      "text": "把塑料瓶剪成细条，作为3D打印机的耗材，因为PET塑料可熔融挤出，实现回收利用。",
      "taskId": "aut-bottle",
      "configId": "structured-cot",
      "generation": 1,
      "agent": "structured-cot",
      "source": "baseline"
    },
    {
